clean_summary:
Just found out that FlashAttention uses a lookup table and linear approximation to accelerate softmax. We tried similar strategies in our work at MSR two years ago on A100, achieving over a 20% end-to-end speedup of self-attention.

If you are interested in how to parallelize the lookup table and linear approximation to replace non-linear functions, please take a look at our paper.

